WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.730
Two people help at a food
bank on the same afternoon.

2
00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.460
One does it to look good on social media.

3
00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.610
The other does it simply
because it is right.

4
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:13.380
Many Hindus would say these two
actions are not the same at all,

5
00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:16.160
because karma is about intention.

6
00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:19.400
If your life now is shaped
by what you did before,

7
00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.580
are you still free to choose?

8
00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:26.000
In this mission, you'll meet an archer,
a quiver and an arrow in flight:

9
00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:29.090
a classic picture of three kinds of karma.

10
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:34.760
Then you'll weigh up a hard question: is
karma a fair explanation of suffering?

11
00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:37.720
Your mission: work out
whether, for Hindus,

12
00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.970
karma leaves you free to choose.
